# Writing Cursor Rules

Don't write ❌ BAD items, only ✅ GOOD items

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD - Proper ARIA for alerts
<div role="alert" aria-live="polite">Error message</div>

// ✅ GOOD - Decorative icons hidden from screen readers
<IconCheck aria-hidden="true" className="size-4" />

// ✅ GOOD - Interactive elements use button semantics
<button onClick={handleClick} aria-label="Close">
  <IconX aria-hidden="true" />
</button>
```
